  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If I mute myself in VR, and then go back to my desk to do some work, I don't want VRChat to unmute me just because I moved the mouse over the VRChat window by accident.\n\nWhen I'm at the desk, I'm not planning to talk to people, so unmuting provides no clear benefit.\n\nIf anything, the opposite would be nice - if the game detects that I'm not in VR anymore, it could automatically mute me, and then unmute me when the headset goes back on.",
